long-chord pockets, exterior caps or quadratic-core container cases.
The macroface interior is isolate-only, so deletion-overlap savings
cannot be counted there; its original strict refill still needs one
extra site. The manifest confirms contact coordinates/residual cage
scope on the container core, but supplies no protected wall or surplus.

